      <h1>How Discreet Log Contracts Work</h1>
      <p class="msc-learn-page__deck">Discreet Log Contracts use preconstructed Bitcoin transactions and oracle signatures to settle event-dependent payouts without making the oracle a custodian. Learn how announcements, event descriptors, funding transactions, CETs, adaptor signatures, refunds, multi-oracle designs, privacy, fees, and implementation maturity fit together.</p>
      <ul class="msc-learn-page-meta"><li>Innovation</li><li>Deep</li><li>Technical Analysis</li><li>17 to 20 minutes</li><li>Reviewed null</li></ul>
